  notesName: Captain Notes 2
  notesIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee8ef0258b43ee5489a2d851d6278cdf, type: 3}
  notesDescription: Within the heart of the island lies a hidden sanctuary, a temple
    meticulously crafted to safeguard the most prized possessions of Nyi Roro Kidul.
    Here, the legendary green emerald stone and the exquisite green sash adorned
    with gold motifs are carefully preserved, embodying the Queen's boundless wealth,
    unending prosperity, and the harmonious well-being she bestows upon her realm.
    Congratulations! For your invaluable assistance to the island's villagers, Nyi
    Roro Kidul herself has graciously revealed the path to this sacred place. To
    reach it, simply follow the main village road; the temple patiently awaits at
    the very end of the path, its presence a testament to your commendable efforts.
